WEBVTT

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:15.020
The deciding battle between the Toyotomi and 
Tokugawa clans reached its final act.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>We need only take Lord Ieyasu's head.</i>

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.960
<i>Episode 12</i>

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.960
<i>The Mightiest Warrior in Japan</i>

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.880
<i>They almost resemble a sea of 
red amaryllises in full bloom.</i>

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:39.690
<i>But whose graves will they adorn?</i>

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.390
It's a fire that threatens to swallow us whole.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:52.560
No matter how it may rage, a fire 
cannot dry out the entire ocean.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:55.930
All troops, move out!

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:24.680
Ignore Yukimura, and head 
straight for Osaka Castle.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:30.020
The moment we fell the castle, we win this war.

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:34.290
Put an end to it, with your own hands.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.250
I understand.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:45.560
<i>If only it were that simple, though...</i>

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.330
I wish you luck.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:01:59.990
<i>Yukimura...</i>

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:04.350
Let's go!

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:06.930
Charge!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:53.520
I'll take care of you all.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:08.370
Osaka Castle                      Hirano River

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.420
Thus began a back-and-forth battle.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:04.740
Faced with a numerical disadvantage,

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:08.370
the Toyotomi army gathered its troops in the 
middle, to force a central breakthrough.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:14.380
To counter, the Tokugawa army also 
focused its troops in the middle.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:37.860
E-Enemy spotted!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.700
It's Yukimura Sanada!

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:05.180
Osaka Castle                      Hirano River

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.630
Luring the enemy into the middle was 
part of the Toyotomi army's plan,

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:05.180
so that Yukimura could charge through 
the loosely-guarded flank.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.250
Yukimura,

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.530
I won't let you get to Lord Ieyasu!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.510
Sorry, Nobuyuki,

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.490
but you're fighting me.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.270
Lord Keiji...

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.030
Masamune!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:43.510
I'll pay you back twice over for what you did!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.450
Idiot.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.770
This will be my final battle.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.400
Make sure to leave no regrets.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.190
Yes, my lord!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:05.030
<i>A war like this was unnecessary.</i>

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:10.350
<i>In its current state, you could have used 
cannons to easily fell this castle.</i>

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.770
<i>Lord Ieyasu,</i>

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:17.540
<i>I see you, yourself, are still trapped 
in the Warring States Era.</i>

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.000
<i>With this war, I must put our nation's 
history of chaos to rest.</i>

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.680
<i>I imagine you feel the same, Hideyori.</i>

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:34.020
<i>I am the living embodiment 
of the Toyotomi clan's past.</i>

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:38.030
<i>And with this war, I shall cut it 
free of its wretched shackles.</i>

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.690
<i>The Warring States Era dies here.</i>

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.890
Lord Yukimura!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.670
Stay back!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.660
Yukimura Sanada!

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.680
Crossing swords with you once 
more brings me great joy!

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:18.940
However, I will not let you approach my lord!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:22.060
I cannot afford

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.570
to stop here!

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.600
Lord Yukimura!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.540
What's the matter?

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.730
Is that all you have?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.730
I'm not done yet!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.950
<i>I'm so excited, my blood's boiling.</i>

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:22.500
<i>As I thought, I can live only on the battlefield.</i>

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.070
<i>And he's the same.</i>

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.720
<i>That is why I must ensure that 
this battle is the last...</i>

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:35.430
<i>For both Yukimura</i>

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.510
<i>and myself!</i>

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.190
Lord Yukimura!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.080
Look out!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.870
Hang in there...

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.300
Can you hear my voice?

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.980
Answer me!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:45.370
No! You mustn't die!

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.360
You have to live on!

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:56.380
I'm sorry...

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:01.890
If I'd put up a better fight, you wouldn't 
have ended up this way!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:07.860
Forgive me!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.620
This is...

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:30.700
Lord Mitsunari...

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.930
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.120
It was merely chance.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.410
I cannot afford to go down here.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:07.880
I shall put everything I have into this blow!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.380
I applaud your spirit!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.750
Magnificently done.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.510
Now, go...

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:02.260
Settle things, with your own hands.

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.320
I shall.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.120
Lord Tadakatsu,

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:10.520
could I ask you to take care of her?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.980
Leave it to me.

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.350
Thank you.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:29.660
<i>Forgive me, my lord.</i>

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.370
<i>In my final battle, I have been defeated.</i>

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.690
Go, Nobuyuki!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:49.720
Lord Kanetsugu!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.230
Fulfill your duty.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:56.760
So you came, after all.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.040
Is instigating a fight between 
brothers what you call love?

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.450
Nobuyuki has a firm resolve.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.510
Letting him do as he likes is how I show my love!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.160
Love

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.910
No! The gate has been breached?!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.750
My family is in there!

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.320
You're too slow!

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.100
Shut up!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.990
Kiyomasa...

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:18.100
Osaka Castle                      Hirano River

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.330
A few hours after the battle began,

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.220
the Tokugawa army was making 
full use of their numbers,

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.370
dividing the Toyotomi troops

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.610
and picking them off, one-by-one.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:38.150
The Toyotomi clan's past is filled with chaos.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.280
And I shall take everything with me.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.130
Osaka Castle                      Hirano River

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:45.550
As the Toyotomi army's defeat drew ever closer,

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:50.390
Yukimura made a beeline for Ieyasu's base camp.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.770
Keep him away from Lord Ieyasu!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.330
Yukimura!

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:18.080
Prepare yourself, Lord Ieyasu!

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.750
So you've come.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.330
Stop!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.340
Yukimura!

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:27.590
Brother...

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.590
I'll handle him, Lord Ieyasu.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:33.540
My lord!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:34.760
Yes.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.140
Lord Nobuyuki...

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:45.610
<i>I knew this day would come.</i>

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.340
<i>I'm ready.</i>

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.630
Lord Hideyori...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:20.390
Why will you not use your courage 
to create a better future?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.530
Lord Hideyori...

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.410
The castle tower...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.160
Guess it's all over.

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:48.740
Yukimura, settle things for yourself.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.920
Lord Hideyori...

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.310
Run away, all of you!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.580
Lady Kai...

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.430
We'll stay until the end.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:02.690
No! You must live on!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:04.090
But...

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.290
Hurry!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.770
Okay!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:12.170
Lord Hideyori...

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:26.790
<i>May this flame turn the chains of chaos to ash.</i>

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.720
Come, Yukimura.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.310
As you wish!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.540
Brother!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.910
Yukimura!

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.930
Lord Nobuyuki! Yukimura!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:34.780
How strong you've grown, Yukimura...

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.700
You are, no doubt, the mightiest warrior in Japan.

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:40.700
Brother...

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:48.160
But that is exactly why I must kill you.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:54.090
To show that samurai warriors have no 
place in the peaceful world to come.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:02.600
To wipe out the Toyotomi clan and show that 
the country belongs to the Tokugawa alone.

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:07.350
To prove that, under their banner, 
there will never be warfare again.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.980
And to put an end to the Warring States Era.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.110
Yukimura,

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.890
I shall cut you down.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:22.770
Then I shall respond with every ounce 
of strength left in my body,

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.300
and protect our pride as warriors!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.820
Your feelings have reached me, Brother.

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:09.490
The responsibility of ending the Warring 
States Era rests with me, a warrior!

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.190
Yukimura...

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:19.620
Hurry!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.720
We have to save Father, no matter what!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:26.480
I leave the Sanada clan in your hands,

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.180
and I wish you and Sister a happy life.

00:19:30.550 --> 00:19:35.430
I shall see to the soul of the Sanada 
and the warrior spirit myself!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.330
Yukimura...

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.860
Yukimura!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.490
Yukimura...

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:58.250
Lord Yukimura...

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:11.350
Behold, the soul of the Sanada!

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.790
I am terribly sorry.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.730
I could not kill Yukimura...

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.040
No matter.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:44.430
We are now one step closer to 
realizing a world of peace.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:20.990
The war ended in a Tokugawa clan victory.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:24.300
And with the Summer Siege of Osaka,

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.740
the curtain fell on the Warring States Era.

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:07.740
Lord Yukimura,

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.620
I kept my promise.

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:20.460
<i>Yukimura,</i>

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:25.090
<i>I shall continue to protect the 
flowers you left behind.</i>

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:42.770
Sengoku Musou 
High School

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:42.770
12th Period

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:45.520
Lady Nene's rice balls are the best!

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:47.540
Uh, why is that one so big?

00:23:47.540 --> 00:23:49.440
But it tastes great.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:50.600
Really?

00:23:53.050 --> 00:23:54.280
So salty!

00:23:55.010 --> 00:23:57.010
Get back here, Sakon!

00:23:57.010 --> 00:23:58.290
Sit down and eat!

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:03.470
Let's come see the cherry 
blossoms again next year.

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:04.210
Yes!

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:09.540
See you later!

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:09.750
<i>See you later!</i>
